data: {"id": "660fba07ce7441b8-final", "run_id": "660fba07ce7441b8", "seq": 1181, "ts_ms": 1789147562286, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v11/workload` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-v11/workload 处于 Pending 状态，容器 app 持续报 CreateContainerConfigError，无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` | Fact `fact-2d93f4c24bd6`：`couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input` | 直接定位到具体的资源缺失及键名错误，解释容器无法配置的原因。 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | Fact `fact-05048ce85df0`：`container.waiting_reason = CreateContainerConfigError` | 确认 kubelet 在拉取镜像和启动容器前即失败的错误类型。 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | Fact `fact-698681450fc4`：`pod.phase = Pending` | 确认 Pod 停留在调度和启动前阶段，未进入运行状态。 |\n| 4 | Metric | `prometheus` | Fact `fact-0f307a74f107`：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1` (reason: `CreateContainerConfigError`) | 从指标层面独立印证了 Pod 处于配置错误的等待状态。 |\n| 5 | K8s State | `kubernetes` | Fact `fact-c73c0acc1309`：`container.restart_count = 0` | 证明容器从未成功启动，排除因运行时资源耗尽导致的反复崩溃重启。 |\n\n**证据说明：**\nKubernetes 原生状态与 Prometheus 指标高度一致：`CreateContainerConfigError` 明确指出了配置解析失败，而非健康检查失败或资源调度问题；重启次数为 0 与“配置无法生效导致无法启动”的逻辑完全吻合。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input 中缺失 key unavailable-key → Pod 容器启动时无法注入环境变量/配置 → kubelet 拒绝启动容器并报告 CreateContainerConfigError → Pod 卡在 Pending 状态，app 容器持续报错。\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **配置引用不匹配**。\n\nPod 定义（实体 `aiops-case-v11/workload`）试图从 ConfigMap `aiops-case-v11/workload-input` 中读取 `unavailable-key`，但该 ConfigMap 实例中实际不存在此键。这一配置层面的冲突导致 kubelet 在启动阶段即阻断容器初始化，从而引发 `CreateContainerConfigError` 和 `Pending` 状态。证据 `fact-2d93f4c24bd6` 提供了确凿的原文报错。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 59.4s\n├─ 问题定位: 14.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v11/workload: 35.7s (Evidence 28.4s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v11/workload**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 59.377, "metrics": {"run_id": "660fba07ce7441b8", "mttr": {"value": "59.4s", "seconds": 59.380714893341064, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 59380.714893341064, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 56232.1617603302, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 7682.151794433594, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2860.0144386291504}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 14838.635921478271, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 35661.62943840027, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8853.333711624146, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

